    <description><![CDATA[SongGenix generates complete musical arrangements, custom beats, backing tracks, and ambient soundscapes locally on your Windows PC. 100% offline, royalty-free, and subscription-free.

Licensing: SongGenix is commercial software and requires a paid license key (£19.99 one-time purchase, 12 months of updates included, online activation required; no free trial and no recurring subscription). Purchase at https://razorlinestudios.co.uk/app.php?slug=songgenix.]]></description>
